# Formatting only, and only on what is staged.
#
# `format-check` is the single most frequent CI failure in this repository —
# more than the next three causes combined — and every one of them is the same
# story: a file that Prettier would have fixed in milliseconds instead costs a
# push, a runner, and several minutes before it says so.
#
# Deliberately narrow. Linting and typechecking are not here: they are slower,
# they have not been failing, and a pre-commit hook that takes long enough to
# be annoying is a pre-commit hook people run with --no-verify.
#
# Fixtures are safe: Prettier honours .prettierignore even for the explicit
# paths lint-staged hands it, and `--ignore-unknown` skips file types it has
# no parser for (images, .ico, .nvmrc) rather than failing the commit.
pnpm lint-staged
